{"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"InnoRouterInspector"},{"type":"text","text":" is an opt-in product that observes the canonical"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RouterStore"},{"type":"text","text":" event stream. Timeline capture and pure-reducer previews do not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"intercept or mutate routing operations. The optional deep-link workbench has"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a separate, explicit execution action that submits through the live store."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Create a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorRecorder"},{"type":"text","text":", attach the store that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"should be observed, and retain each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorSubscription"},{"type":"text","text":" for the desired capture"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lifetime. Default formatters retain operation names, outcomes, styles, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"counts while excluding route payload descriptions. A custom"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorFormatter","isActive":true},{"text":" is the explicit opt-in point","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for app-specific details.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorView","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" presents the bounded timeline with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"domain filters, pause\/resume, rejection breakpoints, bookmarks, arbitrary A\/B"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"comparison, native JSON snapshot\/bundle import, bundle export, step controls,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"clear, and entry detail."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"When the app also imports "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"InnoRouterTesting"},{"type":"text","text":", pass a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorScenarioController","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" created by its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"standard "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"routerScenario(store:)"},{"type":"text","text":" adapter. This adds explicit start, progress,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stop, completeness, and raw fixture import\/export. Raw fixture controls are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"visibly separate because route payloads may be present."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Start, stop, and import failures use"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorScenarioFailure","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and localized generic"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"summaries. Arbitrary decoder or application error descriptions are not shown,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and a failed import clears any stale raw fixture that could otherwise be shared."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorSnapshot","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is a value-only, Codable export"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"suitable for attaching to a bug report after the app has applied its own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"retention and disclosure policy."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorDiagnosticBundle","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" wraps that redacted","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"snapshot with its InnoRouter release and Apple platform identity. The recorder","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"encodes bundles with stable JSON key and bookmark ordering. Default formatters","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"remain payload-safe; applications that install custom formatters must review","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the app-owned metadata before sharing a bundle. ","type":"text"},{"code":"importDiagnosticBundle(from:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reopens the session and returns its original environment metadata. Unsupported","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"format versions fail before decoding entries, and failed imports preserve the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"current timeline and bookmarks.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Both recorder encoding methods apply","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorExportLimits","isActive":true},{"text":" to the complete JSON output,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"including a diagnostic bundle’s environment metadata. The provisional,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"uncalibrated default is 8 MiB; configure ","type":"text"},{"code":"exportLimits:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on the recorder to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"choose another finite byte ceiling. This ceiling is independent of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"importLimits:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and the recorder’s entry ","type":"text"},{"code":"capacity","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". A session that satisfies","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one limit need not satisfy the others.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An output exactly at the byte ceiling succeeds. A larger output throws","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorExportFailure","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" with the extensible","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"encodedDataTooLarge"},{"text":" code and actual\/maximum byte counts, without retaining","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entry content. Failure preserves entries, bookmarks, pause settings, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"transition timing. Snapshot encoding still honors the caller’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"JSONEncoder"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and propagates its errors unchanged. The Inspector view’s existing diagnostic","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"export path calls the same bounded recorder method.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The byte check runs after ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"JSONEncoder"},{"text":" produces its ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Data"},{"text":": it bounds the bytes","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"returned for persistence or sharing, not peak transient allocations or the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"memory retained by formatted timeline entries. The value-only "},{"code":"snapshot()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"diagnosticBundle()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" methods do not encode or apply the export byte limit, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"directly encoding those values bypasses the recorder’s export policy."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The recorder can import that export with an explicit replace or append policy."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorPlayback"},{"type":"text","text":" steps through an imported"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"session without a live store, while"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorComparison"},{"type":"text","text":" compares final states across"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sessions or any two captured states in one session. Entries include correlated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"elapsed and transition-duration metadata. All comparisons operate on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"payload-redacted trees, and older snapshots without bookmarks remain decodable."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Byte and entry limits apply to both snapshot and bundle imports before entry"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"decoding. Duplicate envelope keys are rejected, escaped keys are recognized,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and orphan bookmarks are discarded. Replacing a timeline clears live timing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"correlation so imported sessions cannot inherit durations from earlier work."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For a macro router declared with "},{"code":"inspectorCatalog: true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorDeepLinkView","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" is an opt-in URL workbench."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorDeepLinkAnalyzer","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" projects the generated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"catalog, ordered attempts, and terminal failure without route payload values or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"navigation side effects. Its preview API uses the pure reducer for a redacted"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"target diff. The "},{"code":"store:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" view initializer exposes execution separately; only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that explicit action resolves the URL and submits through normal policies."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The default share action uses only the structural decision and declared route"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patterns, never the entered URL. Execution status is structured and localized,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and leaving the workbench cancels only its owned execution task."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Localization","text":"Localization","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Inspector-owned controls, accessibility labels, recording\/execution statuses,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and generic failure messages support English, Korean, Japanese, Simplified and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Traditional Chinese, Spanish, French, German, Italian, Brazilian Portuguese,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Russian, Arabic, Hindi, Indonesian, Vietnamese, and Thai."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Views resolve strings from the package resource bundle using the SwiftUI","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"locale","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" environment, including changes while the same view remains mounted.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Unsupported languages fall back to English. Timeline timestamps use that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"locale’s time formatting.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To select a language for one Inspector subtree, apply"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".environment(\\.locale, Locale(identifier: \"ko\"))"},{"type":"text","text":" to its view. Locale and layout"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"direction are independent SwiftUI environment values: when forcing an Arabic"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"preview in a left-to-right app, also apply"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".environment(\\.layoutDirection, .rightToLeft)"},{"type":"text","text":". Normal host-app language and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layout configuration remains the application’s responsibility."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Locale-only changes preserve the native containers. A layout-direction change"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"recreates the workbench’s native Form and the timeline’s native split\/list"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"boundary on split-view platforms to clear stale mirrored geometry. Stable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"outer containers retain tab identity, recorder, scenario, filter, selection,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"comparison, URL input, and execution ownership. Native focus or scroll position"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"may reset, but a direction change does not cancel an in-flight execution."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Event names, domain\/outcome identifiers, metadata keys, route patterns,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"structural dumps, and exported JSON remain stable diagnostic values. Custom","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"formatter content and successful scenario summaries belong to the app and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are shown verbatim. Native file\/share panels use the host application’s and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"system’s localization, not the package’s catalog.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Scenario recording means capturing navigation events, not screen or audio","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"recording. Stopping retains the captured fixture; cancelling discards it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"without undoing navigation. An incomplete capture is distinct from a capture","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"operation that failed. Raw fixture warnings refer to potentially sensitive","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"route data and must not be removed when translating.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"A bounded, payload-safe navigation timeline for development and diagnostics.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/innorouterinspector\/innorouterinspector"]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Capture","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorRecorder","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorSubscription","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorFormatter"],"anchor":"Capture"},{"title":"Timeline values","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorEntry","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorEventDescription","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorDomain","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorOutcome","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorSnapshot","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorDiagnosticBundle","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorPlayback","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorComparison","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorImportPolicy","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorExportLimits","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorExportFailure","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorExportFailureCode","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorExportFailureDetails","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/documentation\/InnoRouterInspector\/RouterInspectorStateTree","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.inspector\/docume